<title>TUNISIA: SOCCER-ES SAHEL BEAT HEARTS OF OAK 4-1 IN CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ES SAHEL BEAT HEARTS OF OAK 4-1 IN CUP.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-05-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's L'Etoile Sportive du Sahel beat Hearts of Oak of Ghana 4-1 (1-0 half time) in an African Cup Winners' Cup second-round, second-leg match played on Saturday in Sousse, Tunisia.</p>
<p>L'Etoile Sportive won 6-3 on aggregate.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Tunisia - Kais Ghodbane 34, Ferid Chouchaine 53, Zoubeir Beya 81, Riadh Jlassi 82.</p>
<p>Ghana - Avoiko Williams 80.</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000.</p>
</text>
